{"channelId":"UCFB1lFntPi-8bt_C1EbqFQA","row":["MACC TVCTV",1730,"Tualatin Valley Community Television: The mission of TVCTV is to strengthen the fabric of community life by providing communication tools, training and opportunities.\n\nIn order to fulfill this mission, TVCTV works in partnership with individuals, community groups, governments, educational institutions and area businesses.\n\nTVCTV manages Public, Educational and Governmental (PEG) Access channels on the area cable systems though the Metropolitan Area Communications Commission, the cable regulatory agency serving the Tualatin Valley.\n\nMACC's mission is to serve the public interest through developing, overseeing, evaluating and promoting an area-wide cable communication system, and acting as a forum on communication issues and alternatives.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFB1lFntPi-8bt_C1EbqFQA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFB1lFntPi-8bt_C1EbqFQA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:39.818Z","channelId":"UCFB1lFntPi-8bt_C1EbqFQA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"d66515a85a03b20f593a7faaf58a454071a8eebd2da6b0edd54c9256961c62b9","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"520ec09b0bb5d5abedf212137b73885808cd83a9874ad03194c2d64f5f23c983"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFB1lFntPi-8bt_C1EbqFQA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:39.818Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFB1lFntPi-8bt_C1EbqFQA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1730,"raw":"1.73K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFB1lFntPi-8bt_C1EbqFQA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:39.818Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.